0.1.4 records the losses it used to hide. Dropped messages, shortened text, a save that failed after retries, and the time you paused or stopped an app are now gaps or labels. Search no longer calls the first page a total, and a hit opens at that message. On a medium-width screen the conversation keeps a back arrow. Media copies time out instead of hanging Delete everything or Restore; a restore that lost files says so. A refused source change is a dialog, not a silent no-op.
